## Design Tokens (tokens.ts)

### Colors
- **accent**: primary=#007AFF, primaryHover=#0062CC, primaryLight=#E8F2FF, primaryContent=#FFFFFF
- **semantic**: success=#34C759, warning=#FF9500, danger=#FF3B30, info=#007AFF (each with *Light variant)
- **surface.light**: primary=#FFFFFF, secondary=#F2F2F7, tertiary=#E5E5EA, glass=rgba(255,255,255,0.72)
- **surface.dark**: primary=#1C1C1E, secondary=#2C2C2E, tertiary=#3A3A3C, glass=rgba(28,28,30,0.72)
- **text.light**: primary=#1C1C1E, secondary=#6D6D72, tertiary=#AEAEB2, placeholder=#C7C7CC
- **text.dark**: primary=#FFFFFF, secondary=#AEAEB2, tertiary=#6D6D72, placeholder=#48484A
- **border.light**: default=rgba(60,60,67,0.12), prominent=rgba(60,60,67,0.24), focus=#007AFF
- **border.dark**: default=rgba(255,255,255,0.08), prominent=rgba(255,255,255,0.16), focus=#0A84FF

### Spacing (4px base scale)
0, 0.5(2px), 1(4px), 1.5(6px), 2(8px), 2.5(10px), 3(12px), 3.5(14px), 4(16px), 5(20px), 6(24px), 7(28px), 8(32px), 9(36px), 10(40px), 11(44px), 12(48px), 14(56px), 16(64px), 20(80px), 24(96px)

### Radius
none(0), xs(4px), sm(8px), md(12px), lg(16px), xl(20px), 2xl(24px), 3xl(32px), full(9999px)
- Inputs/buttons use md(12px) or 2xl(24px)
- Modals use 3xl(32px)
- Checkboxes use md(12px)

### Shadow (Apple-style soft layered shadows)
sm (cards/inputs), md (dropdowns/tooltips), lg (modals/popovers), xl (floating elements)

### Animation
- duration: instant(0ms), fast(100ms), normal(200ms), slow(300ms), slower(500ms)
- easing: easeOut(0.16,1,0.3,1), easeIn(0.4,0,1,1), easeInOut(0.4,0,0.2,1), spring(0.34,1.56,0.64,1)

### Component Sizes
- componentHeight: sm=36px, md=44px, lg=52px
- iconSize: sm=16px, md=20px, lg=24px
- touchTarget: 44px (WCAG 2.5.5)

### Typography
- fontFamily.sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'SF Pro Display', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif
- fontFamily.mono: 'SF Mono', 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace
- fontSize: xs(12), sm(14), base(16), lg(18), xl(20), 2xl(24), 3xl(30), 4xl(36)
- lineHeight: tight(1.25), normal(1.5), relaxed(1.75)
- fontWeight: regular(400), medium(500), semibold(600), bold(700)

## Theme System (ThemeProvider.tsx)

```tsx
interface ThemeContextValue {
  theme: 'light' | 'dark';
  toggleTheme: () => void;
  setTheme: (theme: 'light' | 'dark') => void;
  isDark: boolean;
}
```

- Storage key: 'beparibd-theme' in localStorage
- Initial: localStorage → system preference (prefers-color-scheme: dark) → 'light'
- Syncs 'dark' class to document.documentElement
- Listens for live system preference changes (only if user hasn't set explicit preference)
- All components use Tailwind `dark:` variants

## Component API Patterns

### Universal Pattern (every component)
1. Parent controlled — all behavior via props, no internal state
2. forwardRef — all interactive components support ref
3. cn() merge — className always merged safely (clsx + tailwind-merge)
4. Dark mode — every color has `dark:` variant
5. Accessible — aria-* attributes, role, linked labels
6. Type safe — full TypeScript interfaces, no `any`


### Button
- Variants: primary | secondary | ghost | danger | outline
- Sizes: sm | md | lg
- Props: variant, size, loading, disabled, fullWidth, iconLeft, iconRight, asChild, className
- Loading: shows spinner + disables + aria-busy
- Icons: LucideIcon type for iconLeft/iconRight
- Score: 9/10 — missing asChild full integration

### Input
- Types: text | email | password | number | search
- Sizes: sm | md | lg
- Props: type, size, label, error, success, helperText, loading, prefixIcon, suffixIcon, fullWidth
- Auto: password toggle when type="password", Search icon when type="search"
- Number: native spinners hidden via CSS
- Score: 9/10 — missing maxLength counter

### Select
- Props: label, error, helperText, options ({label,value,disabled?}[]), placeholder, size, fullWidth
- Same pattern as Input BUT missing: success variant
- Score: 8/10 — missing success, JIT bug (see below)

### Textarea
- Props: label, error, helperText, fullWidth
- Same pattern as Input BUT missing: success variant, size prop, loading state
- Score: 8/10 — missing success/size/loading, JIT bug (see below)

### Checkbox
- Props: label, description, error, checked (all standard HTML input props)
- Custom indicator: sr-only native input + styled div overlay with Check/Minus icons
- Indeterminate: handled via CSS peer-indeterminate
- Score: 8/10

### Radio
- Same API as Checkbox
- Custom dot indicator (circle inside styled div)
- Score: 8/10

### Switch
- Props: label, description
- role="switch" for accessibility
- Green when checked (#34C759/#30D158), gray when off
- Score: 8/10 — missing error state

### Modal
- Parent toggle via open + onClose props
- Sizes: sm | md | lg | xl | full
- Props: open, onClose, title, subtitle, size, closeOnBackdrop, closeOnEscape
- Features: focus trap, focus restore, scroll lock, escape key, glass backdrop
- Accessibility: aria-modal, aria-label, role="dialog"
- Score: 9/10

### Toast
- Pattern: context + provider + hook
- Methods: toast.success(title, message?), .error(), .warning(), .info()
- Auto-dismiss: 5 seconds, manual dismiss via X button
- Accessibility: aria-live="polite"
- Score: 9/10

### DatePicker
- Native <input type="date"> for mobile-friendly date picker
- Same API pattern as Input: label, error, helperText, size
- Props: value(string|null), onChange, min, max, placeholder, required, disabled
- Calendar icon via Lucide Calendar component
- Score: 8/10 — JIT bug (see below), browser-dependent styling

### StatusBadge
- Variants: success | warning | danger | info | neutral
- Uses design tokens for all colors
- Score: 8/10

### Card
- Variants: default | glass
- Glass: backdrop-blur-xl with rgba background
- Props: children, className, variant, onClick, padding
- Score: 8/10

### DataTable
- Generic sortable table
- Props: columns (Column[] with key, title, sortable?, render?), data, keyField, loading, emptyState
- Score: 8/10

### SearchFilterBar
- Search input + filter controls bar
- Composes Input + other controls
- Score: 7/10

## 🔴 CRITICAL BUGS — Tailwind JIT Template Literals

**These components use dynamic class strings invisible to Tailwind JIT compiler. Will silently fail in production.**

```typescript
// ❌ components/ui/Select.tsx — uses componentHeight.sm / radius.lg / radius['2xl'] in template literals
sizeClasses = {
  sm: `h-[${componentHeight.sm}] text-sm rounded-[${radius.lg}] pl-3.5 pr-9`,
  md: `h-[${componentHeight.md}] text-[15px] rounded-[${radius['2xl']}] pl-4 pr-10`,
  lg: `h-[${componentHeight.lg}] text-[17px] rounded-[${radius['2xl']}] pl-5 pr-12`,
}

// ❌ components/ui/DatePicker.tsx — same pattern
sizeClasses = {
  sm: `h-[${componentHeight.sm}] text-sm rounded-[${radius.lg}]`,
  ...
}

// ❌ components/ui/Textarea.tsx — uses radius['2xl'] in template literal
className with `rounded-[${radius['2xl']}] border`
```

**Correct pattern (Input.tsx, Button.tsx do this correctly):**
```typescript
// ✅ Static strings that Tailwind JIT CAN see
const sizeClasses: Record<string, string> = {
  sm: 'h-9 text-sm rounded-lg',      // 36px, 16px
  md: 'h-11 text-[15px] rounded-2xl', // 44px, 24px
  lg: 'h-[52px] text-[17px] rounded-2xl',
};
```

## CSS Custom Properties (index.css)

Tailwind v4 `@theme` block maps design tokens to CSS custom properties:
- `--color-accent-*` → accent
- `--color-semantic-*` → semantic
- `--color-surface-*` → surface
- `--color-text-*` → text
- `--color-border-*` → border
- `--radius-*` → radius scale
- `--shadow-*` → shadow scale
- `--ease-*` → easing curves

Dark mode overrides in `.dark {}` CSS class block.

## Import Paths

```tsx
// Design system foundation
import { tokens, ThemeProvider, useTheme, cn } from '@/src/design-system';
import { accent, semantic, spacing, radius } from '@/src/design-system/tokens/tokens';

// UI components
import { Button, Input, Select, Modal, useToast } from '@/src/components/ui';

// Layout
import { Header, Sidebar } from '@/src/components/layout';
```

## Legacy Components (components/ directory)

27 page components in root `components/` directory. These are being replaced by src/ route-based pages. Do NOT modify these — they use raw HTML elements instead of design system components and will be deleted after migration.

## Architecture Rules

1. Never create huge component first — build smallest stable unit
2. Test after every change
3. Refactor immediately if bad design found
4. Prefer composition over massive props
5. Parent must control behavior via props
6. No duplicated styles — use design tokens
7. No inline magic numbers — use tokens
8. No dead code
9. No unnecessary abstraction
10. No unnecessary state
11. All interactive components: forwardRef + cn() + dark mode + accessibility
12. Import from barrel exports (src/components/ui, src/design-system)
13. TypeScript strict — no `any`
14. Token values in class strings must be STATIC (Tailwind JIT requirement)